            "n": 1,
            "date": "2026-10-07",
            "title": "What happens at a consultation",
            "button": "Book",
            "url": "https://www.alluringplasticsurgery.com/free-consultation?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp-post&utm_content=consultation",
            "media": null,
            "status": "published",
            "status_date": "2026-10-07",
            "text": "What happens at a consultation at Alluring Plastic Surgery?\n\nYour first visit is a conversation, not a sales pitch. You tell us what you'd like to change, we go over your health history, and the surgeon examines the area and explains what is realistic for your body.\n\nYou leave with three things in writing:\n• your surgical plan\n• your price\n• your surgery, pre-op and follow-up dates\n\nThe consultation is free. If you'd rather start from home, ask for a virtual consultation."
        },
        {
            "n": 2,
            "date": "2026-10-15",
            "title": "Flying in from another state",
            "button": "Learn more",
            "url": "https://www.alluringplasticsurgery.com/fly-in-consultation?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp-post&utm_content=fly-in",
            "media": "ca-patient",
            "media_note": "ca-patient needs a release and names the surgeon; a fresh storefront photo from the practice is the safer pick. travel-surgeon is NOT allowed.",
            "status": "draft",
            "text": "Coming from another state for surgery in Miami?\n\nMany of our patients fly in. Before you book a flight, you need three dates, and we give you all three in writing:\n• your surgery date\n• your pre-op and follow-up appointments\n• how many nights to stay in Miami before you're cleared to fly home\n\nStart with a virtual consultation from wherever you live in the US. Once your plan is set, you book travel around confirmed dates.\n\nFlights and lodging are yours to choose. We take care of the clinical side."
        },
        {
            "n": 3,
            "date": "2026-10-22",
            "title": "Hablamos español",
            "button": "Book",
            "url": "https://www.alluringplasticsurgery.com/consulta-gratis?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp-post&utm_content=espanol",
            "media": "es-surgery-day",
            "status": "draft",
            "text": "Hablamos español.\n\nEn Alluring Plastic Surgery nuestro equipo te atiende en español, desde la primera llamada hasta tus citas de seguimiento.\n\nEn tu consulta gratis recibes por escrito:\n• tu plan quirúrgico\n• tu precio\n• tus fechas de cirugía, preoperatorio y seguimiento\n\nSi vives fuera de Miami, puedes empezar con una consulta virtual."
        }
    ],
